      "stale_hits": [],
      "global_stale_hits": [],
      "answer": "TL;DR: The Shepherds are a cult known as the Shepherd\u2019s Flock, and they serve Maelthor, acting to advance that power\u2019s influence through recruitment and violent \u201ccleansing.\u201d\n\nThe **Shepherds (Shepherd\u2019s Flock)** are a cult group currently active in the city, notably staging protests and recruiting from vulnerable or transformed individuals. They present themselves publicly as defenders of human settlements, but internally they justify extreme acts as necessary sacrifices.\n\nThey explicitly **answer to Maelthor**:\n- OBSERVED: They are \u201cfollowers of Maelthor.\u201d\n- OBSERVED: They are aligned with \u201cMaelthor\u2019s influence and emergence.\u201d\n\nTheir doctrine includes:\n- CANON: Belief that their actions \u201ccleanse the world of impurities resisting Maelthor\u2019s influence.\u201d\n- CANON: A goal of ensuring human supremacy.\n- OBSERVED: Active recruitment, especially of those already affected or transformed.\n\nThey also conceal darker activities (e.g., hiding corrupted meat) and maintain symbols tied to their group.\n\nKey Attributes:\n- Faction: Followers of Maelthor (OBSERVED)\n- Role: Cultists staging protests and recruiting (CANON/OBSERVED)\n- Goals: Cleansing, recruitment, human supremacy (CANON)\n- Alignment: Devoted to Maelthor\u2019s influence and emergence (OBSERVED)\n- Activity: Active in public unrest and covert operations (CANON/OBSERVED)",
      "embedding_similarity": null
    },
    {
      "id": "q_the_city_council_2",
      "question": "Who speaks for the wizards on the council, and what's his angle on the cult?",
