      "answer": "TL;DR: The Council Chambers were heavily disrupted\u2014set ablaze by a Fireball, magically activated (runes and illusions), and left disheveled after the chaos.\n\nDuring Session 12 (OBSERVED), the **Council Chambers** saw several major changes:\n- The room was engulfed when **\u201calmost the entire room is lit up by Fireball\u201d**, indicating widespread damage or at least intense magical impact.\n- **Runes along the walls activated when Caelynn cast her spell**, meaning dormant defenses were triggered and likely altered how the room functioned mid-encounter.\n- **Illusory Walls** became active/present in parts of the chamber, changing navigation and visibility inside the room.\n- The chamber\u2019s overall **physical_condition is now \u201cDisheveled\u201d**, reflecting the aftermath of combat and magical disruption.\n\nThese changes are all OBSERVED, so they represent the current state of the room post-session.\n\nKey Attributes:\n- Atmosphere: Fireball-lit, chaotic\n- Defenses: Activated runes, Illusory Walls\n- Geography: Large circular chamber with central table (unchanged structurally)\n- Physical Condition: Disheveled",
